      "licenseEvidence": "Exact FWS page labels Media Usage Rights/License Public Domain. Photo By/Credit is Photo; no named creator supplied.",
      "visibleScene": "Two juvenile red foxes rest closely in dry vegetation. The left fox rests its lower jaw against the forehead of the right fox; both have visible eyes. The right fox is the proposed narrator.",
      "fictionBoundary": "Narrator and sister identities, sex, past sleep, easing away, sliding, returning and sigh are invented. The still shows close head contact, not those temporal actions or sleep.",
      "taxonEvidence": {
        "taxon": "Vulpes vulpes",
