        "sex": "Photographic sexes unrecorded; male narrator and female sister remain fiction",
        "sourceLocation": "Not specified on source page; no geographic claim extracted from it"
      },
      "continuity": "Existing ordinary-red-coat male Rufus, fictional southern Ontario home, approximately 44.0, -79.5. Existing juvenile brother and sister already established. When we were small explicitly makes this an adult recollection, without reversing chronology or changing existing passages. No offspring, mate, subspecies or new profile.",
      "distinctionAudit": "Not a new wrestling defeat, yawn, mouse pounce or egg carry, but root identified a cross-cast repeat of newly accepted Mabel. Hold takes precedence.",
